    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23995fbc6cb553f9d41691d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看看喔。伸展运动、慢跑、爬梯训练跟跑外围。\n其他还有重训、阶梯冲刺跟起跑训练。\n还要用到迷你跨栏……",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cb028cff4c47eb3e6a07dcc92c4cc45f27e00169a885239c860dc74d1633b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
